{"id":"b5af116b-e674-493b-b50f-f3c2243dddd8","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"7d3794f9ece2c187","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/workspace-tools.ts","baseline":{"blob":"8d271b1df81369406c0490b4c1a03ddbf163495c","start":2348,"end":2417},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","EXCLUDE_REFS","=","`","{**/node_modules/**,**/.git/**,","${","REFS_DIR","}","/**}","`"]},"context":{"before":"c125cab5c0cb51e2","after":"96392d6c31f79b63"}},"payload":{"text":"The same, and the commits opened beside the work (git-refs.ts): a glob or grep reaches them when its pattern names\n`.refs/`.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:33:17.375Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:33:17.375Z"}
{"id":"bc08290f-72ee-48eb-bf7c-78adfa939502","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"a4eb2d27eddc588a","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/workspace-tools.ts","baseline":{"blob":"96fe47d2309f3021f84759eab4a31539def9a204","start":0,"end":46},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","Hub","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/hub","\""]},"context":{"after":"e46e22f049b9d08c"}},"payload":{"text":"The workspace as an agent works in it — as it would on a local machine (ARCHITECTURE.md, *Workspace tools*;\ndebug-mcp's files_* tools, app/tools/):\n\n- `files.read` { path, offset?, limit? }: a file's text, numbered as `cat -n` numbers it — what's open in an editor,\nunsaved edits included, else what's on disk;\n- `files.write` { path, content }: a file made, or its whole text replaced;\n- `files.edit` { path, old, new, all? }: an exact string replaced — found once, or every time with `all`;\n- `files.replace` { edits: [{ path, old, new, all?, count? }], preview? }: exact strings replaced across files, all or\nnothing — each must be found as it says (once, `count` times, or every time with `all`) and none may overlap\nanother, or nothing changes and the answer says each that didn't hold; then one edit, every file saved. With\n`preview`, the diff it would make, and nothing changed;\n- `files.glob` { pattern, limit? }: the workspace's files a glob matches;\n- `files.grep` { pattern, glob?, ignoreCase?, limit? }: the lines a regular expression matches, in the files a glob\n(default: every file) matches.\n\nA write or an edit goes through VS Code's documents, as typing would: an open editor shows it, undo takes it back, the\nedit history records it, and saving runs what saving runs (format on save). Paths are the workspace's: relative to it,\nor absolute under it. Runs in the workbench realm (core), with its own extension API.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:33:49.780Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:33:49.780Z"}
{"id":"c691248a-c46f-4ee3-a2d5-cfa96eaa3eff","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"f64453c4f49ac8b8","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/workspace-tools.ts","baseline":{"blob":"af3b425ae743553abb47d009d1f6c8cdf038f111","start":5417,"end":5940},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","applyAndSave","=","async","(","uri",":","vscodeApi",".","Uri",",","edits",":","(","document",":","vscodeApi",".","TextDocument",")","=>","{","\"","range","\"",":","vscodeApi",".","Range",";","\"","text","\"",":","string","}","[]",")",":","Promise","<","void",">","=>","{","const","document","=","await","vscode",".","workspace",".","openTextDocument","(","uri",")",";","const","edit","=","new","vscode",".","WorkspaceEdit","(",")",";","for","(","const","{","range",",","text","}","of","edits","(","document",")",")","{","edit",".","replace","(","uri",",","range",",","text",")",";","}","if","(","!","await","vscode",".","workspace",".","applyEdit","(","edit",")",")","{","throw","new","Error","(","`","","${","relative","(","uri",")","}"," couldn't be edited","`",")",";","}","await","saveDocument","(","document",",","relative","(","uri",")",")",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"8f41e94e1dde3c56","after":"74aecd7c18173298"}},"payload":{"text":"Edits to `uri`'s text, as typing makes them (an open editor, undo, the edit history), then saved.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:32:38.548Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:32:38.548Z"}
{"id":"cb774cd1-a58a-4d3d-856a-e25c2b9f7fd2","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"0b90c98f5d9dca5f","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/workspace-tools.ts","baseline":{"blob":"efdcf845b861587cacf39c32568f211ef83d9529","start":20502,"end":20626},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","named","=","typeof","glob","===","\"","string","\"","&&","glob","!==","\"","","\"","?","glob",".","replace","(","/","^\\/workspace\\/","/","u",",","\"","","\"",")",".","replace","(","/","\\/+$","/","u",",","\"","","\"",")",":","undefined"]},"context":{"before":"9b02479b98ad0101","after":"731976416fbc6ce7"}},"payload":{"text":"(a folder or a file named without a wildcard is what's in it, or it: a folder's name alone matches no file)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:31:24.591Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:31:24.591Z"}
